@fact tobias.scholarship
# en: A farmer's son on a turnip scholarship, built like a barn door and gentle as a lamb.
text [2b6d69] = 一个拿芜菁奖学金的农家子弟，块头像谷仓门，性子像小羊羔。

@fact tobias.plants
# en: He talks to plants. Worryingly, they seem to answer.
text [e42ce7] = 他会跟植物说话。令人担心的是，它们似乎会回答。

@fact tobias.ma
# en: His mother runs the farm alone at harvest. It's the first harvest he has ever missed.
text [b4dd4f] = 收获季节，他母亲一个人打理农场。这是他第一次错过收获。
# en: Ask about harvest at home.
hint [a2ef64] = 问问他家里的收成。

@fact tobias.gerald
# en: He is raising a mandrake called Gerald, who wears a knitted hat and screams softly.
text [f5ffc4] = 他在养一株叫杰拉尔德的曼德拉草，戴着一顶针织小帽，会轻声尖叫。
# en: Ask about the mandrake in the hat.
hint [1205f8] = 问问那棵戴帽子的曼德拉草。

@fact tobias.moonflowers
# en: The greenhouse moonflowers bloom once every eleven years. He would stand in a storm for them.
text [047bca] = 温室里的月光花每十一年才开一次。为了它们，他愿意站在暴风雨里。
# en: Look in the greenhouse at night.
hint [7995d0] = 夜里去温室看看。

@fact tobias.blight
# en: Blight took his family's harvest. Thirty crowns stood between them and a hungry winter.
text [15f8ba] = 枯萎病毁了他家的收成。他们和一个挨饿的冬天之间，只隔着三十克朗。
# en: Home may be having a bad year.
hint [3fa934] = 家里今年也许过得不好。

@fact tobias.dancing
# en: He practised waltzing with a broom before the Midwinter Ball. The broom complained.
text [3db4ab] = 冬至舞会前，他拿一把扫帚练华尔兹。扫帚提出了抗议。
# en: Ask him about the Midwinter Ball.
hint [93f4a0] = 问问他仲冬舞会的事。

@fact tobias.after
# en: His mother expects him home on the farm after graduation. It was always the plan; he isn't sure any more that it's his.
text [850e1d] = 他母亲指望他毕业后回农场。这一直是计划；他已经不确定这是不是他自己的计划了。
# en: Ask what he'll do after graduation.
hint [07dbcd] = 问问他毕业以后打算做什么。
